{"id":"wb-3-253","name":"显陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"明显陵","text":"明显陵，是明世宗朱厚熜的生父睿宗献皇帝朱祐杬及生母慈孝献皇后蒋氏的合葬陵寝，是中国明代帝陵中最大的单体陵墓。\n明显陵是明嘉靖时期“大礼议”的产物，由于其特殊的历史背景，在规划布局和建筑手法上与其他帝王陵寝相比，有其独特之处。陵寝结构为“一陵两冢”，金瓶形的外罗城、九曲回环的御河、龙形神道和圆形内外明塘等，都是明代帝王陵寝中绝无仅有的。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E6%98%BE%E9%99%B5","revisionId":93402515,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93402515","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3333a9fb4db8387a7a5cd7d9.jpg","title":"Mingxianling_minglou.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mingxianling_minglou.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Mingxianling_minglou.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kallgan","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​湖北安陆明显陵明楼及宝顶","width":320,"height":427}}